bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_inline_button_label_whole_pen_2026-11-28, 0, "After 35d45555c32 only an auto-width <button> item of a plain nowrap, non-reversed row flex container starts its label at the item's exact LayoutUnit left edge. Still on the old placement: (1) an inline (non-flex) auto-width button, whose label starts at the whole-px pen although the box sits at the exact inline pen; (2) buttons in row-reverse / rtl rows; (3) buttons in wrapping rows (flex-wrap: wrap); (4) rows with justify-content:center, where the start offset is a whole px. Chrome 159 places all of these in LayoutUnits. None is Chrome-measured yet."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_render_inline_button_label_whole_pen_2026-11-28, P3, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "web render: inline button labels start at the whole pen; reversed, wrapped and centred button rows keep whole-px placement", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl, 5250, "<div><button>Go</button><button>HTML</button></div> and display:flex rows with flex-direction:row-reverse, flex-wrap:wrap, justify-content:center at device scale 1 and 4; compare label ink columns with Chrome 159", 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_inline_button_label_whole_pen_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 tabbar lane: the row gates are button_in_flex_row (nowrap, not row_flex_main_reversed) and flex_row_button_label_at_edge; the inline case needs run_pen_origin to accept a centred auto-width button line. tab-bar residual after the fix is AA level only (1x 0.02, 4x 0.01)."
    web_render_inline_button_label_whole_pen_2026-11-28, 1, "2026-11-28 button-label-cluster lane: measured in Chrome 159 at k=1 and 4 (inline Go/HTML/CSS Layout, wrap, row-reverse, justify-content:center rows; 200 px wrapping row Overview/Forms | CSS Paint/HTML). Inline, reversed and centred rows already matched at both scales on base 2bc96bcf7de (the shard's whole-pen premise is stale after ba32f7509eb); k=4 matched everywhere. Red at k=1 only: a button that ends a WRAPPED flex line painted to its whole-px box edge (Forms right border 129 vs Chrome 128, HTML 134 vs 133). Fix (layout_engine.spl wrapped-row loop): at k=1 the auto-width button records inline_button_k1_snap_px from its exact pen, as the nowrap row and the inline loop do. Red->green: test/01_unit/browser_engine/button_input_device_width_chrome159_spec.spl AC-3. Residual, not asserted: centred row at k=1, the CSS Paint label's last ink column is 275 vs Chrome 276 (label pen sub-px; borders match). Not measured: rtl (direction:rtl) button rows.

